{"4368640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DIG Raiders: Anomaly Extraction", "steam_appid": 4368640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIG Raiders</strong> is a single or multiplayer co-op mining adventure that blends exploration, extraction, and alien encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an alien spacecraft crashed deep beneath the city, most people saw it as an apocalyptic disaster. But to veteran contractors, it’s a jackpot! You’ve taken on massive debt to buy up this plot of land, and the only way to turn your life around is to dig deep for endless underground treasures. Grab your pickaxe, call your friends, plant some explosives, and let's get digging!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368640/extras/45e1b3977aec5b4a9928581225ae47a1.poster.avif?t=1788270671\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368640/extras/45e1b3977aec5b4a9928581225ae47a1.webm?t=1788270671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368640/extras/45e1b3977aec5b4a9928581225ae47a1.mp4?t=1788270671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig Deeper:</strong> Navigate through 9 underground levels in search of aliens and hidden treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Story Mode:</strong> Team up in 1-4 player co-op to complete wacky quests filled with absurd and hilarious elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Exploit&quot; the Aliens:</strong> Put them to work and make them do the dirty, heavy lifting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4v4 Treasure Hunt:</strong> Compete against other teams and pull off thrilling extractions with your hard-earned loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear Up:</strong> Collect loot, upgrade your equipment, and unlock new playable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage the Industrial Zone:</strong> Put aliens to work producing resources and build fully automated assembly lines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Empire:</strong> Use discovered resources to construct a bustling Entertainment Street and become the ultimate master of wealth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bizarre Animal Suits:</strong> Choose from 7 quirky animal outfits that provide unique stat boosts, including movement speed, HP, and damage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Want to hunt for treasure, tase some aliens, or get rich overnight? Just start digging!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DIG Raiders</strong> is a single or multiplayer co-op mining adventure that blends exploration, extraction, and alien encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When an alien spacecraft crashed deep beneath the city, most people saw it as an apocalyptic disaster. But to veteran contractors, it’s a jackpot! You’ve taken on massive debt to buy up this plot of land, and the only way to turn your life around is to dig deep for endless underground treasures. Grab your pickaxe, call your friends, plant some explosives, and let's get digging!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368640/extras/45e1b3977aec5b4a9928581225ae47a1.poster.avif?t=1788270671\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368640/extras/45e1b3977aec5b4a9928581225ae47a1.webm?t=1788270671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4368640/extras/45e1b3977aec5b4a9928581225ae47a1.mp4?t=1788270671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig Deeper:</strong> Navigate through 9 underground levels in search of aliens and hidden treasures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Story Mode:</strong> Team up in 1-4 player co-op to complete wacky quests filled with absurd and hilarious elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Exploit&quot; the Aliens:</strong> Put them to work and make them do the dirty, heavy lifting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4v4 Treasure Hunt:</strong> Compete against other teams and pull off thrilling extractions with your hard-earned loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear Up:</strong> Collect loot, upgrade your equipment, and unlock new playable characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage the Industrial Zone:</strong> Put aliens to work producing resources and build fully automated assembly lines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Empire:</strong> Use discovered resources to construct a bustling Entertainment Street and become the ultimate master of wealth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bizarre Animal Suits:</strong> Choose from 7 quirky animal outfits that provide unique stat boosts, including movement speed, HP, and damage.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Want to hunt for treasure, tase some aliens, or get rich overnight? Just start digging!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "DIG Raiders is a multiplayer co-op mining adventure combining exploration, extraction, and aliens. An alien ship crashed deep beneath the city, and you’ve bet your life savings to buy the land. All you have to do is d